Lawnchair itself is not part of this repository: scripts/build-lawnchair.sh
builds it from a separate clone of the upstream repository, at the commit named
in patches/BASE. Copyright and license notices of upstream files modified by
the patches are kept unchanged in those files.


Binary releases of the phone app
--------------------------------

The phone app (HomaLawn-<version>-release.apk, published as GitHub releases
tagged build-<N>) contains Lawnchair, Launcher3 and the libraries Lawnchair
bundles, together with Homa Lawn's patches. The notices and license texts of
those libraries are included in the app: Homa Lawn's settings › About ›
Open-source licenses.

One of the bundled libraries, me.xdrop:fuzzywuzzy, is licensed under the GNU
General Public License, version 2 or later. The complete corresponding source of
each release is:
  - this repository at the release's tag (build-<N>), and
  - the Lawnchair commit named in patches/BASE at that tag
    (https://github.com/LawnchairLauncher/lawnchair), with patches/ applied by
    scripts/build-lawnchair.sh.
Each release's notes name both.

Fonts shipped by Lawnchair (Google Sans Flex) keep their own license, the SIL
Open Font License, Version 1.1.


